name pstring
category Package
revision 42857
shortdesc Typeset sequences with justification pointers
relocated 1
longdesc This package lets you typeset justified sequences, also called
longdesc pointing strings. It's used for instance, in research papers
longdesc about Game Semantics to represent sequence of game moves with
longdesc their associated justification pointers. Depending on wether
longdesc using LaTeX or pdfLaTeX, the package uses PSTricks and pst-node
longdesc respectively pgf/TikZ.
runfiles size=7
 RELOC/tex/latex/pstring/pstring.sty
